---
import BaseLayout from "../../site/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../../site/styles/colour-system-study.css";
---

<BaseLayout title="Colour system study — Mourne Made" description="A colour system study for Mourne Made." hideFooter>
  <main class="colour-system-study">
    <div class="shell colour-study-intro">
      <a href="/prototypes/note-pin-study/">← Note pin study</a>
      <p class="home-kicker">Mourne Made · colour study</p>
      <h1>What should carry the brand?</h1>
      <p>Three blue-led systems applied to the same small set of interface roles. The goal is to find a palette that feels deliberate on both white and dark surfaces.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="shell colour-study-grid">
      <article class="colour-system colour-system--mono"><header><b>A</b><div><strong>Blue only</strong><small>One colour, no secondary accent</small></div></header><div class="swatches"><i class="swatch swatch--blue"></i><i class="swatch swatch--ink"></i><i class="swatch swatch--white"></i><i class="swatch swatch--foam"></i></div><div class="sample sample--mono"><button>Request a free before-and-after</button><a href="#">Browse transformations <span>→</span></a><em>Independent concept.</em></div><p>Most focused and mature. Hierarchy comes from weight, borders, and surface changes.</p></article>
      <article class="colour-system colour-system--ink"><header><b>B</b><div><strong>Blue + ink</strong><small>Primary blue, near-black secondary</small></div></header><div class="swatches"><i class="swatch swatch--blue"></i><i class="swatch swatch--ink"></i><i class="swatch swatch--white"></i><i class="swatch swatch--foam"></i></div><div class="sample sample--ink"><button>Request a free before-and-after</button><a href="#">Browse transformations <span>→</span></a><em>Independent concept.</em></div><p>More contrast and a little more character, without introducing a second hue.</p></article>
      <article class="colour-system colour-system--deep"><header><b>C</b><div><strong>Blue + deep blue</strong><small>Primary blue, darker blue secondary</small></div></header><div class="swatches"><i class="swatch swatch--blue"></i><i class="swatch swatch--deep"></i><i class="swatch swatch--white"></i><i class="swatch swatch--foam"></i></div><div class="sample sample--deep"><button>Request a free before-and-after</button><a href="#">Browse transformations <span>→</span></a><em>Independent concept.</em></div><p>Stays within the coastal blue family while giving links and states more separation.</p></article>
    </div>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
